					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151102,
					"content": "呼…终于！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151103,
					"content": "如何？旅者。在这场向岩神辞行的旅途里，有什么收获吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151104,
					"content": "真是一趟奇奇怪怪的旅途。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151105,
					"content": "奇奇怪怪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151106,
						10151107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151106,
					"content": "不知该说是体验了富豪的生活…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151108,
					"content": "哈哈哈，答案是哪一种呢？旅途中的疑问，总是如此复杂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151109,
					"content": "旅者的体验就交给旅者自己慢慢咀嚼吧。对了，作为一起筹办「送仙典仪」的报酬，我决定——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151110,
					"content": "请客。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151111,
						10151112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151111,
					"content": "钟离…请客？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151113,
					"content": "嗯？哦，放心。这一次，我会记得带钱的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151114,
					"content": "今天晚上，我会带你去寻访市井盛赞的港口老窖。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151115,
					"content": "港口老窖？喝酒的那种吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151116,
					"content": "没错。我们在码头附近的「三碗不过港」，不见不散。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151112,
					"content": "天啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151107,
					"content": "还是体验了贫者的挣扎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151108
					]
				}
			]
		},
